createArtDecoRoom()
    Create a lit salon scene and demand-loaded procedural architecture.
    Return the shared-room interface: scene, surface, exit, height, canStand,
    spawnZ, limitX, limitZ and update.
    Use the existing courtyard renderer and camera rig.
    Keep the entry view free of text and instruction panels.
    On update rotate the armillary at one radian per eighteen seconds.
    Use the doorway and existing menu for return navigation.
